211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (I market my jewelry business primarily through social media and events like pop-ups. Social media platforms have been instrumental in reaching my target audience by showcasing my designs, engaging with potential customers, and running targeted ads. This helps build brand awareness and drive traffic to my business. Additionally, participating in pop-up events allows me to connect with customers in person, provide a tangible experience of my products, and gather direct feedback. These strategies have been effective in building a loyal customer base and increasing visibility for my jewelry business.)
/E (I market my jewelry business primarily through social media and events like pop-ups. Social media platforms have been instrumental in reaching my target audience by showcasing my designs, engaging with potential customers, and running targeted ads. This helps build brand awareness and drive traffic to my business. Additionally, participating in pop-up events allows me to connect with customers in person, provide a tangible experience of my products, and gather direct feedback. These strategies have been effective in building a loyal customer base and increasing visibility for my jewelry business.)
/Pg 11 0 R
