221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (My top three pieces of advice for aspiring student entrepreneurs are: don't lose hope, trust the process, and keep working towards your end goal. Stay focused on your long-term objectives and embrace the journey, even when faced with setbacks. What keeps me motivated and inspired is the progress I see from my hard work and the support from my friends, family, and best friend. )
