/S /P
/ActualText (The Heart Stopping Drops of Risk)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Taking calculated risks is what separates the true entrepreneurs from the rest. Embrace the adrenaline rush, trust your instincts, and take that leap of faith. Who knows? The biggest drop might just lead you to the greatest rewards!)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Twists and Turns of Adaptability)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Just when you think you have it all figured out, the entrepreneurial roller coaster throws you a curveball. Suddenly, the market changes, new technologies emerge, and customer preferences shift. But fear not! The key to staying on track is adaptability. Embrace the twists and turns, pivot when necessary, and keep your eyes open for opportunities that might surprise you around the next corner.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
